# Docker build context for `frontend/Dockerfile` (context: ./frontend), built by
# the `frontend` service of docker-compose.yml. The root `Dockerfile` does not
# read this file: its context is the repository root (see /.dockerignore).
#
# The build stage runs `npm ci` from package*.json, then `COPY . .` and
# `npm run build` (vue-tsc + vite), then nginx copies dist/ and
# nginx.conf.template. Sources, configs and public/ must stay in the context.

# Recreated by `npm ci` / `npm run build`. A host node_modules would also
# overwrite, at `COPY . .`, the one `npm ci` just installed for the image's
# platform.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

# Local env / secrets
.env
.env.*

# Logs, editor and OS noise
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Docker files themselves (the builder still reads them)
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
